 "honest_notes": [
  "B=500/1000 cuts are continuity carriers; at u>=9 their expected event yield is ~0 (rho(9)=1.0e-9 .. rho(11)=6.5e-13) so their CIs are wide-or-empty BY DESIGN and carry no inference weight",
  "j<=3s cap truncates the top of band 11 (achieved u_max reported empirically from the bitlen histogram)",
